"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T13:23:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T13:23:46Z","body":"Looks like a bug. The signal is not added to the list by any method changed by this PR. Seems to affect only script signals. Open an issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805203057/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805260512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112770#issuecomment-3805260512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112770","id":3805260512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iz6rg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T13:36:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T13:36:18Z","body":"I personally don't think we can just hide those completly. For C++ there is an asymmetry: the classes are used in GDScript but they are never written in GDScript. This means there is no situation were you would want to access something private.\r\n\r\nFor script members that's different. Not only the user code is written with autocompletion. Also the original code which works with private members is written with it. Hiding them without some sort of access resolution would make working with such classes easier, but it would make it annoying to develop classes with private members.\r\n\r\nAnd well, access resolution isn't exactly straight forward, if we want to do that, we should have consensus on behaviour first.\r\n\r\nRelated:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93210\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103768","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805260512/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805383172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112770#issuecomment-3805383172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112770","id":3805383172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7i0YoE","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-27T14:01:59Z","updated_at":"2026-01-27T14:01:59Z","body":"Right, this is irrelevant for scripts. It's the same for methods and properties.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3805383172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]